WEBVTT

00:00:11.039 --> 00:00:12.910
[chirping]

00:00:20.048 --> 00:00:21.875
This was stupid.

00:00:27.881 --> 00:00:29.883
- [gasps]
- [dragon growls]

00:00:31.668 --> 00:00:33.409
[scraping]

00:00:33.583 --> 00:00:35.802
[growling]

00:00:37.891 --> 00:00:39.980
- [growls]
- [panting]

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:46.900
[growls]

00:00:53.472 --> 00:00:54.778
[gasps]

00:00:59.696 --> 00:01:00.914
[snarls]

00:01:01.089 --> 00:01:03.874
[bellows, growls]

00:01:04.962 --> 00:01:07.965
Why don't you just fly away?

00:01:08.139 --> 00:01:09.575
[roars]

00:01:17.017 --> 00:01:18.018
[growls]

00:01:30.509 --> 00:01:31.510
[gasps]

00:01:31.684 --> 00:01:33.121
[pencil clatters]

00:01:36.646 --> 00:01:38.082
[low growl]

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:46.830
[Gobber] Where did Astrid
go wrong in the ring today?

00:01:47.004 --> 00:01:49.485
[Astrid] I mistimed
my somersault dive.
It was sloppy.

00:01:49.659 --> 00:01:50.747
It threw off
my reverse tumble.

00:01:50.921 --> 00:01:52.444
[Ruffnut] Yeah, we noticed.

00:01:52.618 --> 00:01:54.490
No, no, you were great.
That was so "Astrid".

00:01:54.664 --> 00:01:57.493
She's right. You have to be
tough on yourselves.

00:01:57.667 --> 00:01:58.972
Where did Hiccup go wrong?

00:01:59.147 --> 00:02:01.801
- Uh, he showed up.
- He didn't get eaten.

00:02:01.975 --> 00:02:03.586
He's never
where he should be.

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:05.849
Thank you, Astrid.

00:02:06.023 --> 00:02:10.593
You need to live
and breathe this stuff.
The dragon manual.

00:02:10.767 --> 00:02:14.858
Everything we know about
every dragon we know of.

00:02:15.032 --> 00:02:17.034
- [thunder rumbles]
- Ah.

00:02:17.208 --> 00:02:19.689
No attacks tonight.
Study up.

00:02:19.863 --> 00:02:21.473
Wait, you mean read?

00:02:21.647 --> 00:02:22.996
While we're still alive?

00:02:23.171 --> 00:02:24.955
Why read words when you
can just kill the stuff

00:02:25.129 --> 00:02:26.783
the words
tell you stuff about?

00:02:26.957 --> 00:02:29.916
I've read it seven times.
There's this water dragon

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:33.529
that sprays boiling water
at your face. And there's
this other one...

00:02:33.703 --> 00:02:35.226
Yeah.
That sounds great.

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:38.534
- There was a chance
I'd read it...
- But now...

00:02:38.708 --> 00:02:40.100
You guys read.
I'll go kill stuff.

00:02:40.275 --> 00:02:43.060
Another one
has spines like trees.

00:02:43.234 --> 00:02:46.063
- So I guess we'll share?
- Read it.

00:02:46.237 --> 00:02:50.110
Uh, all mine, then. Wow.
So, OK, I'll see you...

00:02:50.285 --> 00:02:52.809
- [door slams]
- ...tomorrow.

00:02:57.988 --> 00:03:00.077
[thunder rumbles]

00:03:02.775 --> 00:03:04.212
Dragon classifications.

00:03:04.386 --> 00:03:08.085
Strike class.
Fear class. Mystery class.

00:03:08.259 --> 00:03:10.261
- [thunder rumbles]
- Thunderdrum.

00:03:10.435 --> 00:03:13.699
This reclusive dragon
inhabits sea caves
and dark tide pools.

00:03:13.873 --> 00:03:16.876
When startled, the Thunderdrum
produces a concussive sound

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:18.748
that can kill a man
at close range.

00:03:18.922 --> 00:03:21.620
Extremely dangerous.
Kill on sight.

00:03:21.794 --> 00:03:25.885
Timberjack.
This gigantic creature
has razor-sharp wings

00:03:26.059 --> 00:03:27.931
that can slice through
full-grown trees.

00:03:28.105 --> 00:03:30.977
Extremely dangerous.
Kill on sight.

00:03:31.151 --> 00:03:34.677
Scauldron. Sprays scalding
water at its victim.

00:03:34.851 --> 00:03:36.069
Extremely dangerous.

00:03:36.244 --> 00:03:38.246
- [thunderclap]
- [gasps]

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:46.123
Changewing. Even newly
hatched dragons can spray
acid. Kill on sight.

00:03:46.297 --> 00:03:49.953
Gronckle. Zippleback.
The Skrill.

00:03:50.127 --> 00:03:53.870
Bone Knapper.
Whispering Death.

00:03:55.306 --> 00:03:57.134
Burns its victims.
Buries its victims.

00:03:57.308 --> 00:04:00.093
Chokes its victims.
Turns its victims
inside out.

00:04:00.268 --> 00:04:03.227
Extremely dangerous.
Extremely dangerous.

00:04:03.401 --> 00:04:07.100
Kill on sight.
Kill on sight. Kill on sight.

00:04:08.798 --> 00:04:10.756
Night Fury.

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:14.847
Speed unknown.
Size unknown.

00:04:15.021 --> 00:04:18.721
The unholy offspring of
lightning and death itself.

00:04:18.895 --> 00:04:20.679
Never engage this dragon.

00:04:20.853 --> 00:04:22.638
Your only chance:

00:04:22.812 --> 00:04:24.944
hide and pray
it does not find you.

